WEBVTT

00:13:30.147 --> 00:13:32.691
And sometimes, he would say things like,

00:13:32.715 --> 00:13:34.526
"John, do you still preach?"

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:35.798
And I would say,

00:13:35.822 --> 00:13:39.234
"Yes, Dr. King, when I'm taking
a shower so no one can hear me."

00:13:39.258 --> 00:13:41.722
BS: (Laughs)

00:13:41.746 --> 00:13:42.963
JL: And he would laugh.

00:13:42.987 --> 00:13:45.058
I think when he was assassinated,

00:13:45.082 --> 00:13:46.375
when he died,

00:13:47.724 --> 00:13:50.807
something died in all of us.

00:13:51.265 --> 00:13:55.990
If he had lived --
he was a very young man --

00:13:57.275 --> 00:14:00.523
maybe our country would be much better